{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Quest is a Card Collecting simulator focused around opening Card Packs live on an in-game Stream and selling your Cards at the local Convention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_004559.png?t=1744144658\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow Your Stream:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day you can open Card Packs on Stream, and your growing Community will share the excitement with you!  <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/image_2025-04-04_004503221.png?t=1744144658\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Run your own Booth:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Head to the local Convention to sell your Cards, then buy Packs for more fun on Stream! Will you only sell Duplicate Cards or will you part with the most valuable pieces of your Collection?  <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/New_Project__5_.png?t=1744144658\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect Them All!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Quest has hundreds of unique Cards to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three separate Trading Card Games: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cheopets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alienmon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroes vs Villains</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each TCG comes with different Sets and Cards of various Rarities! Can you collect them all?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/image_2025-04-04_012500579.png?t=1744144658\" />\u00a0<i>(screenshot is not a final count of cards)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353700?t=1744144658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353700?t=1744144658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/af5bdd148e7c39b915a8da0a92be324797cde9b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744144658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/af5bdd148e7c39b915a8da0a92be324797cde9b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744144658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Quest is a Card Collecting simulator focused around opening Card Packs live on an in-game Stream and selling your Cards at the local Convention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_004559.png?t=1744144658\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow Your Stream:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day you can open Card Packs on Stream, and your growing Community will share the excitement with you!  <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/image_2025-04-04_004503221.png?t=1744144658\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Run your own Booth:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Head to the local Convention to sell your Cards, then buy Packs for more fun on Stream! Will you only sell Duplicate Cards or will you part with the most valuable pieces of your Collection?  <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/New_Project__5_.png?t=1744144658\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect Them All!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Quest has hundreds of unique Cards to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three separate Trading Card Games: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cheopets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alienmon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroes vs Villains</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each TCG comes with different Sets and Cards of various Rarities! Can you collect them all?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/image_2025-04-04_012500579.png?t=1744144658\" />\u00a0<i>(screenshot is not a final count of cards)</i></p>","developers":["Cluck Games, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/13accb541aa7dcf516034cf563cfe4bbcda4c7e9/header.jpg?t=1744144658","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122060,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122060/movie480.mp4?t=1744144656","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122060/movie_max.mp4?t=1744144656"},"name":"Main Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122060/a4e43eac3df542f3dc4c18538431ea1274e645b7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744144656","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/